      "content": "but it's not just a phase or being tired. it's like the actual substance of who i was is gone. i look at my work and it's just a ghost of what it was. if the thing that makes me \"me\" is gone, then what's even the point of staying around to finish the story? it feels like a story that's already reached its natural end.",
